# Normalize text files to LF in the repository and check them out as LF on every
# platform. Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true rewrites the
# whole tree to CRLF on every checkout, which silently breaks the multi-line
# source assertions in scripts/check.mjs (false "CSS template literal not found"
# style failures) and makes `git status` show hundreds of phantom modifications.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never normalize binary payloads.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.m4a binary
*.aac binary
*.flac binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.tgz binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
